WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:02.775
The same map, now lit by truth.

00:00:03.975 --> 00:00:08.350
Bright means it runs. Dim means planned. The spark means seed.

00:00:09.550 --> 00:00:13.875
Touch the builder. One command. It ends with: quickstart OK.

00:00:15.075 --> 00:00:20.925
Touch the debate. A small bounded argument. No winner this time, and the failure is kept.

00:00:22.125 --> 00:00:27.900
Touch the inspector. Four checks pass. The signed proof verifies, or nothing merges.

00:00:29.700 --> 00:00:34.825
The librarian briefs you and shreds the note. The seed waits its turn, labeled.

00:00:36.025 --> 00:00:40.825
Each helper shows its next step. Dated, or marked waiting on its owner.

00:00:42.025 --> 00:00:48.425
Before: scattered tools and crossed fingers. After: one map, and every step keeps its receipt.

00:00:50.225 --> 00:00:55.475
The map of a mind, with the lights telling the truth.  Open it.
